ption {:value "354505"} "Half-Lightweight (≤66 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "354580"} "Lightweight (≤73 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "354655"} "Half-Middleweight (≤81 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "354730"} "Middleweight (≤90 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "354805"} "Half-Heavyweight (≤100 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "354880"} "Heavyweight (&gt;100 kilograms), Men"] "\n" [:option {:value "354922"} "Extra-Lightweight (≤48 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "354964"} "Half-Lightweight (≤52 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "355006"} "Lightweight (≤57 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "355048"} "Half-Middleweight (≤63 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "355132"} "Half-Heavyweight (≤78 kilograms), Women"] "\n" [:option {:value "355174"} "Heavyweight (&gt;78 kilograms), Women"]] [:script {} "$('#same_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#same_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:form {:class "form-inline form-inline-header"} [:select {:name "id", :id "other_games_select", :class "form-control"} [:option {:value ""} "In other Games"] "\n" [:option {:value "900533"} "1988"] "\n" [:option {:value "17504"} "1992"] "\n" [:option {:value "18252"} "1996"] "\n" [:option {:value "18986"} "2000"] "\n" [:option {:value "19717"} "2004"] "\n" [:option {:value "260781"} "2008"] "\n" [:option {:value "316468"} "2012"] "\n" [:option {:value "18001382"} "2020"] "\n" [:option {:value "2007262"} "2024"]] [:script {} "$('#other_games_select').change(function(){location.href='/results/' + $('#other_games_select').val();})"]] " | " [:a {:href "/event_names/354"} "Event type"]] [:h1 {:class "event_title"} "Middleweight (≤70 kilograms), Women" [:small {}]] [:table {:class "biodata"} [:tbody {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Date"] [:td {} "10 August 2016"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Status"] [:td {} "Olympic"]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Location"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/venues/902"} "Arena Carioca 2, Parque Olímpico da Barra, Barra da Tijuca, Rio de Janeiro"]]] [:tr {} [:th {} "Participants"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/events/355090"} "24 from 24 countries"]]]]] [:div {:class "description"} [:p {} "Japan celebrated a clear sweep in the two middleweight judo events on the same day in Rio, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/120790"} "Haruka Tachimoto"] " claiming the gold in the women’s 70 kg division and " [:a {:href "/athletes/134774"} "Mashu Baker"] " in the men’s 90 kg division. For Tachimoto, Colombia’s triple World Champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/112601"} "Yuri Alvear"] " was the woman she had to beat in front of what proved to be a “home crowd” for the South American. Being ranked a lowly 12, Tachimoto had to win some difficult fights in the elimination rounds. In her second bout she faced the top seed, and triple European Champion, " [:a {:href "/athletes/131177"} "Kim Polling"] " from Netherlands and advanced into the next round by a Yuko in the Golden Score period. In the quarter-finals, she scored a Waza-ari against Canada’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/122809"} "Kelita Zupancic"] ". In the semi-final, against eventual bronze medal winner " [:a {:href "/athletes/130390"} "Laura Vargas Koch"] " from Germany, she had to go the full four minutes but held on to an advantage scored by a Waza-ari after 1:38 min. Although she had been penalized for non-combativity early in the fight Tachimoto came back, throwing Alvear with a Tani-otoshi (Valley drop) for a Waza-ari and pinned her on the ground for the required 20 seconds to score an Ippon (Full point) after 2:19 min. Second-seeded Alvear, bronze medalist in London 2012, was Colombia’s flag bearer at the Opening Ceremony in Rio. The two defeated semi-finalists, Vargas Koch and Britain’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/122986"} "Sally Conway"] ", who eliminated reigning World Champion " [:a {:href "/athletes/112613"} "Gévrise Emane"] " from France, claimed the two bronze medals. " [:a {:href "/athletes/131477"} "Mabika Yolande Bukasa"] ", originally from Democratic Republic of Congo but in Rio representing the Refugee Olympic Team, had to leave the Olympic stage after just 1:03 min in her first bout losing by an Ippon."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/120790"} "Haruka Tachimoto"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/JPN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/JPN.png"}] "JPN"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/112601"} "Yuri Alvear"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/COL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/COL.png"}] "COL"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/122986"} "Sally Conway"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/130390"} "Laura Vargas Koch"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "=5"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/129097"} "Bernadette Graf"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUT"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/AUT.png"}] "AUT"]] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :s